notes.notes:
Hello dear Yellow Taxi aficionados, beloved players and pizza lovers! 

We've been listening to your feedback and couldn't resist taking a joyride through your suggestions. Here's what's revving up in this latest update:

[list]
[*] Moved unreachable gears withing bounds in Granny's Island demo version;
[*] Moved unreachable bunnies within bounds, in Granny's Island demo version;
[*] Fixed taxi not flipping back up on some slopes;
[*] Arcade Panik: Visual rework of the pachinko-like minigame;
[*] Arcade Panik: Moved buttons and other stuff for better maneuverability;
[*] Arcade Panik: Added a rocket launcher for soft lock situations inside the rockets' area;
[*] Moved some stuff around in Morio's Home, mainly to prevent accidental camera glitches;
[*] Ui fix: The correct amount of gears will now be displayed when going back to Granny's Island;
[*] Other minor bug fixes;
[/list]

We wanted to give a special shoutout to our incredible community for the invaluable feedback and for breaking the game in unforeseeable ways. Your enthusiasm and dedication keep us motivated and vrooming!

Keep those wheels turning, those spin-o-willing, and as always, if you spot any more quirks or have wild ideas, let us know! 

Now go vroom!
